<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FIVE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FIVE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the fifth</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 6-2 6-4 2-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4 6-7 (3-7) 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 5-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-1 6-3 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>8-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Thierry Champion (France) 6-1 3-0</p>
<p>retired injured</p>
<p>15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-3 5-7</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>4-6 6-7 (6-8) 8-6</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Nicolas Escude (France) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>ENDS MEN'S RESULTS</p>
</text>
